OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain and some
OL,7,Fblustery winds at times. This soon
OL,8,Fclears east through the morning to
OL,9,Fallow increasing bright spells, and
OL,10,Fjust the odd coastal shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,13,Fevening with increasing clear spells
OL,14,Fand light winds. Staying dry overnight
OL,15,Fand becoming quite chilly.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FDry and bright but somewhat
OL,18,Fchilly start. Sunshine turning hazy as
OL,19,Fcloud gradually spills east through
OL,20,Fthe afternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,21,Fevening. Gusty winds developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
